    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "Welcome to the Jeff Florian Nick Show. And our show is a very informative show that helps bring folks together in order to make our nation a stronger and better place to live. And by finding solution, we can all chip in and be supportive of and involved with. Today, we have an incredible guest, one who has been in the United States legislature. as a congressman since 2011, none other than Congressman Bill Johnson. Congressman, how are you today? Well, I'm doing good, Pastor. How are you? Oh, I'm doing excellent. So glad to have you on this day and in this climate of just a busy election season and year. We've got some very pressing issues that we'd like for you to just kind of elaborate on and inform our audience. Just give us another perspective of where we are. And Congressman, tell us about your district, where you're from. And of course, you represent the great state of Ohio. Congressman, you've got the floor.",
