  {
    "episode_id": 73277,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/3/73277.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "We're going to get right into it. We've got some very pressing issues today. Americans are hurting. Americans are divided. And we are all about bringing people together and with understanding and dialogue. That's what I show us about right now. We're dealing with this. crazy inflation that we've never seen and you know spending that kind of appears to be out of control as well and it seems like everyone wants to spend and most of us when we don't have the money we just don't spend it can you tell us to kind of elaborate on that just talk about it for a bit",
