        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the Congressman as a trustworthy source on governmental and economic challenges.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Public discourse on systemic issues like supply chains contributes to democratic engagement.",
