        "text": "The pandemic disrupted global supply chains due to restrictions on travel and worker mobility.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Outsourcing has led to the transfer of intellectual property to foreign countries.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "During the pandemic, production and shipping were severely limited because factories could not operate normally.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "America currently lacks domestic manufacturing capacity for essential goods like pharmaceuticals, batteries, and medical supplies.",
