        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Policymakers in Washington DC are capable of recognizing systemic vulnerabilities after experiencing a crisis.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a moral obligation to ensure Americans' access to basic necessities through self-sufficiency.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
